<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        width: 80%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        border-radius: 5px;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
      }
      h1 {
        color: #0056b3;
      }
      .section {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        color: #777;
      }
      ul {
        list-style-type: disc;
        margin-left: 20px;
      }
      ol {
        list-style-type: decimal;
        margin-left: 20px;
      }
      a {
        color: #0056b3;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <!-- 英文部分 -->
      <div class="section">
        <p>Dear <%= @submission_data['studentName'] %>,</p>
        <p>Congratulations! You have successfully registered for the AI4S TEEN Challenge Series. We are thrilled to have you join this exciting competition, where you will have the opportunity to showcase your skills, tackle complex problems, and connect with young minds passionate about artificial intelligence from around the world.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Registration Details -->
      <div class="section">
        <h2>Registration Details:</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Student Name:</strong> <%= @submission_data['studentName'] %></li>
          <li><strong>Country of Residence:</strong> <%= @submission_data['countryOfResidence'] %></li>
          <li><strong>School Name:</strong> <%= @submission_data['schoolName'] %></li>
          <li><strong>Date of Birth:</strong> <%= @submission_data['dateOfBirth'] %></li>
          <li><strong>Email Address:</strong> <%= @submission_data['email'] %></li>
          <li><strong>Supervising Teacher:</strong> <%= @submission_data['supervisingTeacher'] %></li>
          <li><strong>Main Subject(s) Taught by the Supervising Teacher:</strong> <%= @submission_data['mainSubjects'].join(', ') %></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Key Dates -->
      <div class="section">
        <h2>Key Dates to Remember:</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Registration Period:</strong> December 27, 2024 - January 18, 2025</li>
          <li><strong>Competition Period:</strong> December 27, 2024 - January 18, 2025</li>
          <li><strong>Final Competition Period:</strong> January 20, 2025 - January 26, 2025</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Next Steps -->
      <div class="section">
        <h2>Next Steps:</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Preparation:</strong> You can start preparing for the competition by reviewing the provided materials and resources available on the official competition website.</li>
          <li><strong>Access Competition Questions:</strong> You will be able to view and start working on your solutions on the competition platform.</li>
          <li><strong>Submission:</strong> Ensure you submit your completed tasks via the competition platform before January 18, 2025.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Additional Information -->
      <div class="section">
        <p>For real-time updates, important announcements, and interactions with fellow participants, make sure to join our community on <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/D6zNyZbloBmIczukXAWvOQ">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:ai4s@mcaai.org">ai4s@mcaai.org</a>.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Closing Remarks -->
      <div class="section">
        <p>Best of luck, and we look forward to your participation!</p>
        <p>Warm regards,</p>
        <p>AI4S Preparation Committee</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>